window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I </b><b><i>accidentally</i></b><b> slept with my fated mate… and now, he wants to make it permanent.</b></p> <p>It doesn't help that I may or may not be growing his baby as we speak.</p> <p>Avoiding him seems like a waste of effort, considering he won't take no for an answer.</p> <p>So, I've settled for trying my best not to let him know about the possibility of a pregnancy.</p> <p>If I can't avoid telling him, he's going to hold on to me even tighter, and let's be honest…</p> <p>I'm probably going to fall in love with him.</p> <p><b>The Art of Avoiding Your Soulmate </b><b><i>is a steamy, fun, standalone novella with a happily ever after!</i></b></p>"; 
